  "steps": [
    "Dressing. Whisk mayo, sour cream, lime juice, garlic, sugar, cayenne, salt and pepper until smooth.",
    "Cheese and herbs. Stir in the Cotija and cilantro.",
    "Thin. If too thick, whisk in a little milk or pasta water.",
    "Combine. Pour half the dressing over warm or cooled pasta and charred corn and toss.",
    "Chill. Refrigerate at least 30 minutes. Before serving, stir in the rest of the dressing with extra Cotija, green onions or jalapeño."
